"x":1044,"y":438,"width":70,"height":28},{"text":"빠르겠는가?","x":1123,"y":438,"width":133,"height":28}]},{"text":"12.6 합병 정렬","words":[{"text":"12.6","x":416,"y":727,"width":79,"height":48},{"text":"합병","x":510,"y":724,"width":86,"height":53},{"text":"정렬","x":614,"y":725,"width":88,"height":52}]},{"text":"우리가 앞에서 살펴본 정렬 방법들은 비효율적이지만 간단하기 때문에 입력 데이터가 많지 않을","words":[{"text":"우리가","x":410,"y":869,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"앞에서","x":511,"y":870,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"살펴본","x":607,"y":870,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"정렬","x":705,"y":870,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"방법들은","x":772,"y":872,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"비효율적이지만","x":899,"y":872,"width":202,"height":33},{"text":"간단하기","x":1112,"y":874,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"때문에","x":1241,"y":874,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"입력","x":1344,"y":874,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"데이터가","x":1414,"y":873,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"많지","x":1545,"y":872,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"않을","x":1615,"y":872,"width":56,"height":32}]},{"text":"때는 충분히 사용할 수 있는 방법이다. 그러나 입력 데이터가 많으면서 지주 정릴해야 할 필요","words":[{"text":"때는","x":412,"y":923,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"충분히","x":482,"y":925,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"사용할","x":582,"y":925,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":680,"y":926,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":723,"y":925,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"방법이다.","x":793,"y":926,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"그러나","x":929,"y":927,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"입력","x":1031,"y":928,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"데이터가","x":1101,"y":928,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"많으면서","x":1231,"y":928,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"지주","x":1363,"y":929,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"정릴해야","x":1439,"y":927,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"할","x":1571,"y":927,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"필요","x":1614,"y":926,"width":55,"height":32}]},{"text":"가 있으면 이들 방법은 충분하지 못하다. 본 장에서는 앞장의 방법보다 훨씬 빠른 방법들을 소개","words":[{"text":"가","x":411,"y":978,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"있으면","x":453,"y":978,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"이들","x":549,"y":980,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"방법은","x":616,"y":979,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"충분하지","x":711,"y":980,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"못하다.","x":837,"y":981,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"본","x":944,"y":982,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"장에서는","x":984,"y":982,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"앞장의","x":1110,"y":981,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"방법보다","x":1209,"y":981,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"훨씬","x":1340,"y":983,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"빠른","x":1411,"y":983,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"방법들을","x":1483,"y":981,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"소개","x":1612,"y":982,"width":55,"height":32}]},{"text":"한다.","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":409,"y":1033,"width":66,"height":31}]},{"text":"합병 정렬의 개념","words":[{"text":"합병","x":410,"y":1178,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"정렬의","x":496,"y":1178,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"개념","x":616,"y":1178,"width":67,"height":39}]},{"text":"합병 정* S01삐은 하나의 리스트를 두 개의 균등한 그기로 분할하고 분할된 부그분 리스트","words":[{"text":"합병","x":408,"y":1249,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"정*","x":480,"y":1249,"width":151,"height":33},{"text":"S01삐은","x":642,"y":1250,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"하나의","x":745,"y":1251,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"리스트를","x":843,"y":1251,"width":112,"height":31},{"text":"두","x":965,"y":1254,"width":29,"height":29},{"text":"개의","x":1006,"y":1252,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"균등한","x":1074,"y":1252,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"그기로","x":1172,"y":1252,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"분할하고","x":1272,"y":1253,"width":122,"height":32},{"text":"분할된","x":1405,"y":1255,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"부그분","x":1508,"y":1255,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"리스트","x":1582,"y":1254,"width":85,"height":32}]},{"text":"를 정렬한 다음, 두 개의 정릴된 부분 리스트를 합하여 전체가 정릴된 리스트를 얻고자 하는 것","words":[{"text":"를","x":408,"y":1305,"width":30,"height":29},{"text":"정렬한","x":451,"y":1304,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"다음,","x":549,"y":1304,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"두","x":627,"y":1305,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"개의","x":669,"y":1305,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"정릴된","x":737,"y":1305,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"부분","x":833,"y":1305,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"리스트를","x":904,"y":1306,"width":113,"height":31},{"text":"합하여","x":1028,"y":1306,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"전체가","x":1129,"y":1306,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"정릴된","x":1228,"y":1306,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"리스트를","x":1332,"y":1308,"width":120,"height":31},{"text":"얻고자","x":1465,"y":1309,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"하는","x":1568,"y":1309,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"것","x":1640,"y":1310,"width":25,"height":31}]},{"text":"이다. 합병 정렬은 분할 정복(diV1de and conquer) 기법에 바탕을 두고 있다. 분할 정복 기법은","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":409,"y":1358,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"합병","x":490,"y":1359,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"정렬은","x":560,"y":1359,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"분할","x":655,"y":1359,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"정복(diV1de","x":726,"y":1358,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"and","x":882,"y":1363,"width":51,"height":25},{"text":"conquer)","x":944,"y":1360,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"기법에","x":1078,"y":1361,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"바탕을","x":1176,"y":1361,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"두고","x":1276,"y":1363,"width":61,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":1351,"y":1362,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"분할","x":1432,"y":1363,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"정복","x":1507,"y":1363,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"기법은","x":1580,"y":1364,"width":87,"height":32}]},{"text":"문제를 작은 2개의 문제로 분리하고 각각을 해결한 다음, 결괴를 모아서 원래의 문제를 해결하","words":[{"text":"문제를","x":408,"y":1413,"width":90,"height":31},{"text":"작은","x":510,"y":1413,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"2개의","x":579,"y":1413,"width":70,"height":31},{"text":"문제로","x":664,"y":1414,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"분리하고","x":761,"y":1414,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"각각을","x":887,"y":1414,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"해결한","x":986,"y":1415,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"다음,","x":1085,"y":1416,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"결괴를","x":1167,"y":1416,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"모아서","x":1266,"y":1416,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"원래의","x":1371,"y":1418,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"문제를","x":1474,"y":1418,"width":92,"height":31},{"text":"해결하","x":1579,"y":1418,"width":88,"height":32}]},{"text":"는 전략이다. 분리된 문제가 아직도 해결하기 어렵다면, 즉 충분히 작지 않다면 분할 정복 방법","words":[{"text":"는","x":408,"y":1467,"width":31,"height":30},{"text":"전략이다.","x":451,"y":1467,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"분리된","x":588,"y":1468,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"문제가","x":686,"y":1469,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"아직도","x":783,"y":1468,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"해결하기","x":879,"y":1468,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"어렵다면,","x":1007,"y":1470,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"즉","x":1144,"y":1472,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"충분히","x":1184,"y":1470,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"작지","x":1286,"y":1471,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"않다면","x":1360,"y":1472,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"분할","x":1461,"y":1473,"width":63,"height":31},{"text":"정복","x":1537,"y":1473,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"방법","x":1608,"y":1473,"width":54,"height":31}]},{"text":"을 연속하여 다시 적용한다. 분할 정복 기법은 대개 순환 호毳 이용하여 구현된다. 합병 정렬","words":[{"text":"을","x":408,"y":1521,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"연속하여","x":453,"y":1521,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"다시","x":579,"y":1522,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"적용한다.","x":648,"y":1522,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"분할","x":782,"y":1523,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"정복","x":851,"y":1523,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"기법은","x":920,"y":1523,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"대개","x":1018,"y":1525,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"순환","x":1087,"y":1525,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"호毳","x":1157,"y":1525,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"이용하여","x":1259,"y":1525,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"구현된다.","x":1390,"y":1527,"width":128,"height":31},{"text":"합병","x":1535,"y":1527,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"정렬","x":1608,"y":1527,"width":55,"height":31}]},{"text":"은 디음의 단계들로 이루어진다.","words":[{"text":"은","x":408,"y":1576,"width":32,"height":30},{"text":"디음의","x":449,"y":1576,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"단계들로","x":547,"y":1577,"width":113,"height":31},{"text":"이루어진다.","x":671,"y":1578,"width":147,"height":33}]},{"text":"1. 분할(Dmde): 입력 배열을 같은 크기의 2개의 부쁜 배열로 분할한다.","words":[{"text":"1.","x":444,"y":1661,"width":19,"height":28},{"text":"분할(Dmde):","x":477,"y":1658,"width":171,"height":33},{"text":"입력","x":663,"y":1660,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"배열을","x":729,"y":1661,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"같은","x":823,"y":1661,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"크기의","x":888,"y":1661,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"2개의","x":984,"y":1661,"width":71,"height":32},{"text":"부쁜","x":1068,"y":1662,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"배열로","x":1137,"y":1661,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"분할한다.","x":1233,"y":1661,"width":126,"height":32}]},{"text":"2. 정복(Cnnquer): 부분 배열을 정렬한다. 부콭 배열의 크기가 충분히 작지 않으면 순환 호출","words":[{"text":"2.","x":444,"y":1714,"width":22,"height":29},{"text":"정복(Cnnquer):","x":482,"y":1713,"width":201,"height":33},{"text":"부분","x":696,"y":1715,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"배열을","x":765,"y":1715,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"정렬한다.","x":859,"y":1715,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"부콭","x":994,"y":1716,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"배열의","x":1064,"y":1716,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"크기가","x":1160,"y":1716,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"충분히","x":1258,"y":1716,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"작지","x":1360,"y":1717,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"않으면","x":1432,"y":1717,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"순환","x":1534,"y":1718,"width":62,"height":30},{"text":"호출","x":1606,"y":1718,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"을 이용하여 다시 분할 정복 기법을 적용한다.","words":[{"text":"을","x":483,"y":1767,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"이용하여","x":524,"y":1767,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"다시","x":648,"y":1768,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"분할","x":713,"y":1769,"width":58,"height":32},{"tex